## 🔎 Cross-System Comparison

| Dimension | IPC | GJB | GB/T |
|---|---|---|---|
| Standard Nature | Voluntary industry standard | Mandatory military standard | Recommended national standard |
| Grading System | Class 1 / 2 / 3 | Grade Ⅰ / Ⅱ / Ⅲ | By board type |
| Environmental Resistance | Commercial to industrial | Extreme temperature, shock, salt spray | Commercial to industrial |
| Defect Tolerance | Graded tolerance | Near-zero defect | Minor defects acceptable |
| Traceability | Basic | Full-process traceable | Basic |
| Quality System | ISO 9001 | GJB 9001 | ISO 9001 |
| Highest Barrel Copper | ≥ 25 μm | ≥ 25 μm | ≥ 18 μm (multilayer) |
| Acceptance Method | Sampling or full inspection | First article + lot acceptance | Sampling inspection |
| Typical Use Case | Global electronics | Military and aerospace | Domestic civilian PCB |

