## 🎯 How to Select the Right Standard

| Product Type | Recommended Standard |
|---|---|
| Consumer electronics, toys, small appliances | IPC Class 1 |
| Industrial control, telecom, commercial equipment | IPC Class 2 |
| Medical devices, critical automotive electronics | IPC Class 3 |
| Military equipment, aerospace, life support systems | GJB 362B Grade Ⅲ |
| General domestic civilian projects | GB/T 4588 series |
| Space-grade avionics and high-end military systems | GJB Grade Ⅲ + supplements |

