## 🚩 Common Rejection Criteria for IPC Class 2

| Defect Type | Acceptable Condition | Rejection Condition |
|---|---|---|
| Pad / Hole Misalignment | Annular ring ≥ 50 μm | Annular ring breakout or connection failure |
| Solder Mask Dam | Solder mask dam ≥ 50 μm | No isolation between pads |
| Copper Foil Scratch | No substrate exposure, depth < 30% of copper thickness | Substrate exposed or electrical performance affected |
| Measling / Micro-Cracking | ≤ 50 μm, not crossing conductors | Cracks crossing multiple conductors or > 50 μm |
| Void in Hole | Void ≤ 5% of barrel area, not through-wall | Affects continuity or mechanical strength |

